  "path": "/detections/952",
  "status": 200,
  "headers": {
    "content-type": "text/html; charset=utf-8"
  },
  "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<meta name=\"csrf-token\" content=\"<redacted>\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'%3E%3Crect width='16' height='16' rx='3' fill='%23141518'/%3E%3Crect x='5' y='5' width='6' height='6' rx='1' fill='%232dd4bf'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\">\n<title>Detection 952 · gitcorpus</title>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n  try {\n    var stored = window.localStorage.getItem(\"gc-theme\");\n    if (stored === \"light\" || stored === \"dark\") {\n      document.documentElement.setAttribute(\"data-theme\", stored);\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    document.documentElement.removeAttribute(\"data-theme\");\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/static/app.css\">\n<script src=\"/static/htmx.min.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/rownav.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/applib.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/errors.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/recentfilters.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/modalfocus.js\" defer></script>\n<script src=\"/static/app.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#content\">Skip to content</a>\n<div id=\"nav-progress\" class=\"nav-progress\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n<header class=\"site-header\">\n  <a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\">gitcorpus</a>\n  \n  <nav id=\"main-nav\" class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n    <a href=\"/\">Home</a>\n    <a href=\"/runs\">Searches</a>\n    <a href=\"/corpora\">Corpora</a>\n    <a href=\"/filters\">Library</a>\n    <a href=\"/system\">System</a>\n    <a href=\"/detections\" aria-current=\"page\">Detections</a>\n  </nav>\n  <a class=\"status-link\" href=\"/system\" aria-label=\"System status\"><span hx-get=\"/partials/status-dot\" hx-trigger=\"load, every 30s\" hx-swap=\"outerHTML\"></span></a>\n  <button id=\"shortcuts-open\" class=\"button ghost\" type=\"button\" data-open=\"shortcuts-modal\" aria-label=\"Keyboard shortcuts\" title=\"Keyboard shortcuts (?)\">?</button>\n  <button id=\"theme-toggle\" class=\"button ghost\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle dark mode\" title=\"Toggle dark mode\">Theme</button>\n</header>\n<main id=\"content\" class=\"content\">\n\n\n<section class=\"panel\" id=\"run-header\" data-run-id=\"952\">\n  <div class=\"panel-head\">\n    <h1>Detection #1 — search #931</h1>\n    <span class=\"run-hash-wrap\"><span class=\"mono\" data-hash=\"golden-detect\">golden-d</span></span>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"detect-status\" aria-live=\"polite\" data-status=\"done\">\n  <div class=\"run-status-line\">\n    <span class=\"pill done\" data-status=\"done\">Finished</span>\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  \n  \n</div>\n  \n  <details id=\"run-timestamps\">\n    <summary>Technical details</summary>\n    <div class=\"run-meta\">\n      <span id=\"run-id\" data-field=\"run\">run 952</span>\n      <span id=\"run-source\" data-field=\"source\">source api</span>\n      <span id=\"run-created\" data-field=\"created\">created 2026-01-02T00:06:00Z</span>\n      <span id=\"run-started\" data-field=\"started\">started —</span>\n      <span id=\"run-finished\" data-field=\"finished\">finished 2026-01-02T00:07:00Z</span>\n      <span id=\"run-duration\" data-field=\"duration\">duration —</span>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\" id=\"detection-summary\">\n  <div class=\"panel-head\"><h2>Summary</h2></div>\n  <div class=\"cards\">\n    <article class=\"card\">\n      <details class=\"info-pop\">\n        <summary aria-label=\"What repos scanned means\">i</summary>\n        <div class=\"info-pop-body\">\n          <p>Repos from search #931’s frozen result list that this run processed — every item unless a top-N limit was set.</p>\n          <p>Membership is frozen at search time; signal content is fetched live per repo at detection time. Repos the API could not read are counted as unavailable, never dropped.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <h3>Repos scanned</h3><p>1</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\">\n      <details class=\"info-pop\">\n        <summary aria-label=\"What with any signal means\">i</summary>\n        <div class=\"info-pop-body\">\n          <p>Scanned repos with at least one piece of evidence for a selected agent, in any selected channel.</p>\n          <p>This counts repos, not signals — a repo with 200 trailer hits still counts once here. The per-agent totals below show where the evidence lands.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <h3>With any signal</h3><p>1</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\">\n      <details class=\"info-pop\">\n        <summary aria-label=\"What unavailable means\">i</summary>\n        <div class=\"info-pop-body\">\n          <p>Repos the GitHub API could not read during the run: deleted or renamed (404), private without access, or a transport/GraphQL failure that survived retries.</p>\n          <p>They contribute no evidence and are never presented as clean. Resume the run to pick them up; the count also appears in the run summary.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <h3>Unavailable</h3><p>0</p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\">\n      <details class=\"info-pop\">\n        <summary aria-label=\"What the windowed commit ratio means\">i</summary>\n        <div class=\"info-pop-body\">\n          <p>“How much of this repo’s recent work was written with a coding agent?” For each repo we look at the latest 100 commits on its default branch, and count a commit as agent-assisted when its author, its message (an agent co-author or signature line), or the pull request behind it points to a detected agent.</p>\n          <p>Example: a repo where 12 of its counted commits are flagged shows 12%. The number on this card pools every repo in the run — all flagged commits ÷ all counted commits — so repos with more commits count more; it is not the average of the per-repo percentages.</p>\n          <p>Housekeeping commits (merges, reverts, version bumps) and CI bots are skipped on both sides, and only the latest 100 commits are seen: older history and quietly-used agents stay invisible, so treat this as a conservative lower bound.</p>\n          <p>Levels used by the papers: experimental &lt;1% · limited 1–5% · consistent 5–20% · pervasive &gt;20%.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <h3>Windowed commit ratio</h3><p>100.0% <span class=\"muted\">pervasive</span></p>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card\">\n      <details class=\"info-pop\">\n        <summary aria-label=\"What first signal means\">i</summary>\n        <div class=\"info-pop-body\">\n          <p>The earliest date in the window with agent-attributed evidence: the committed date of the oldest matched commit, or the creation date of the oldest matched PR.</p>\n          <p>Because it comes from the 100-commit and most-recent 100-PR windows, it is a lower bound — real adoption may predate it. Full-history dating is the clone tier.</p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n      <h3>First signal</h3><p>2026-01-02 00:00 UTC</p>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div id=\"detection-agents\" class=\"run-counts\">\n    <span class=\"count\">Codex <strong>1</strong></span><span class=\"count\">Claude Code <strong>1</strong></span>\n  </div>\n  \n  \n  <p class=\"muted\">Depth: 100 commits · 100 PRs · 100 issues (windowed). Papers’ baseline: ~0.5–1% false positives, ~3% borderline; detection is an undercount. Hover or tap the ⓘ on any card for details.</p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\" id=\"detection-evidence\">\n  <div class=\"panel-head\">\n    <h2>Per-repo evidence</h2>\n    <div class=\"form-actions\">\n      <a id=\"detection-export\" class=\"button\" href=\"/runs/952/export?format=detections\">Export evidence CSV</a>\n      <a class=\"button\" href=\"/runs/952/export?format=json\">Export JSON</a>\n      <a class=\"button\" href=\"/runs/952/export?format=csv\">Export CSV</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div id=\"detection-filters\" class=\"filter-row\">\n    <label class=\"field\" for=\"detection-filter-signal\">\n      <span class=\"field-label\">Has signal</span>\n      <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"detection-filter-signal\">\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"field\" for=\"detection-filter-agent\">\n      <span class=\"field-label\">Agent</span>\n      <select class=\"field-input\" id=\"detection-filter-agent\">\n        <option value=\"\">All agents</option>\n        <option value=\"Claude Code\">Claude Code</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"field\" for=\"detection-filter-channel\">\n      <span class=\"field-label\">Channel</span>\n      <select class=\"field-input\" id=\"detection-filter-channel\">\n        <option value=\"\">All channels</option>\n        <option value=\"file\">file</option><option value=\"pr_metadata\">pr_metadata</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n  </div>\n  \n  <details class=\"evidence-repo\" id=\"detection-repo-911\" data-agents=\"Claude Code\" data-channels=\"file|pr_metadata\">\n    <summary>octo/alpha · Claude Code</summary>\n    <div class=\"evidence-body\">\n      \n      \n        \n        <div class=\"evidence-channel\" data-channel=\"file\">\n          <h4>file</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li data-agent=\"Claude Code\"><strong>Claude Code</strong> — CLAUDE.md</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        \n      \n        \n        <div class=\"evidence-channel\" data-channel=\"pr_metadata\">\n          <h4>pr_metadata</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li data-agent=\"Codex\"><strong>Codex</strong> — PR #7 → commit a1</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        \n      \n    </div>\n  </details>\n  \n  \n  <p id=\"detection-no-matches\" class=\"muted\" hidden>No repos match these filters.</p>\n  \n</section>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  \"use strict\";\n  var signal = document.getElementById(\"detection-filter-signal\");\n  var agent = document.getElementById(\"detection-filter-agent\");\n  var channel = document.getElementById(\"detection-filter-channel\");\n  var empty = document.getElementById(\"detection-no-matches\");\n  if (!signal || !agent || !channel) {\n    return;\n  }\n  var repos = Array.prototype.slice.call(\n    document.querySelectorAll(\"#detection-evidence details.evidence-repo\")\n  );\n  function hasSignals(repo) {\n    return repo.querySelector(\".evidence-channel\") !== null;\n  }\n  function apply() {\n    var wantSignal = signal.checked;\n    var wantAgent = agent.value;\n    var wantChannel = channel.value;\n    var filteringEvidence = wantAgent !== \"\" || wantChannel !== \"\";\n    var visible = 0;\n    repos.forEach(function (repo) {\n      var sectionsShown = 0;\n      Array.prototype.forEach.call(\n        repo.querySelectorAll(\".evidence-channel\"),\n        function (section) {\n          var channelOk =\n            wantChannel === \"\" || section.getAttribute(\"data-channel\") === wantChannel;\n          var hits = section.querySelectorAll(\"li\");\n          var hitsShown = 0;\n          Array.prototype.forEach.call(hits, function (hit) {\n            var show =\n              channelOk &&\n              (wantAgent === \"\" || hit.getAttribute(\"data-agent\") === wantAgent);\n            hit.hidden = !show;\n            if (show) hitsShown += 1;\n          });\n          section.hidden = !channelOk || hitsShown === 0;\n          if (!section.hidden) sectionsShown += 1;\n        }\n      );\n      var show;\n      if (filteringEvidence) {\n        show = sectionsShown > 0;\n      } else {\n        show = !wantSignal || hasSignals(repo);\n      }\n      repo.hidden = !show;\n      if (show) visible += 1;\n    });\n    if (empty) empty.hidden = visible > 0;\n  }\n  signal.addEventListener(\"change\", apply);\n  agent.addEventListener(\"change\", apply);\n  channel.addEventListener(\"change\", apply);\n})();\n</script>\n\n\n</main>\n<div id=\"shortcuts-modal\" class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"shortcuts-title\" hidden>\n  <div class=\"modal-panel\" role=\"document\">\n    <div class=\"panel-head\">\n      <h2 id=\"shortcuts-title\">Keyboard shortcuts</h2>\n      <button id=\"shortcuts-close\" class=\"button ghost\" type=\"button\" data-close=\"shortcuts-modal\" aria-label=\"Close shortcuts\">Close</button>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"data-table shortcuts-table\">\n      <caption class=\"sr-only\">Keyboard shortcuts</caption>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th scope=\"col\">Key</th><th scope=\"col\">Action</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-h\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>h</kbd></td><td>Go home</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-f\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>f</kbd></td><td>Go to Find</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-r\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>r</kbd></td><td>Go to Runs</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"g-l\"><td><kbd>g</kbd> then <kbd>l</kbd></td><td>Go to Library (filters)</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"j\"><td><kbd>j</kbd></td><td>Select next row</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"k\"><td><kbd>k</kbd></td><td>Select previous row</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"enter\"><td><kbd>Enter</kbd></td><td>Open selected row</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"escape\"><td><kbd>Esc</kbd></td><td>Close this help or a dialog</td></tr>\n        <tr data-shortcut=\"question\"><td><kbd>?</kbd></td><td>Toggle this help</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toast\" class=\"toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" hidden></div>\n</body>\n</html>"
}
